WEBVTT

00:07:57.973 --> 00:08:00.601
and we began to see a pattern.

00:08:01.852 --> 00:08:05.814
It was taking on average
more than four years

00:08:05.814 --> 00:08:09.568
for the US government
to issue these "urgent" visas.

00:08:10.694 --> 00:08:12.863
Which meant that our allies
and their families

00:08:12.905 --> 00:08:14.698
were at risk of Taliban assassination

00:08:14.740 --> 00:08:18.202
because the US couldn't stamp
their passports quickly enough.

00:08:19.537 --> 00:08:20.788
So in response,

00:08:20.829 --> 00:08:23.165
we gathered our knowledge
from all of these cases,

00:08:23.207 --> 00:08:25.084
filed a class action lawsuit,

00:08:25.125 --> 00:08:27.169
and in 2020, we won.

00:08:27.169 --> 00:08:32.758
(Applause)